OL,3,GNEWSATribute cycling bursary set up to
OL,4,Ahelp young riders
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung cyclists are set to benefit from
OL,7,Fan initiate set up in memory of a
OL,8,Fcharity's former chief executive who
OL,9,Fdied earlier this year.
OL,11,FThe Chris Boulton Cycling Bursary has
OL,12,Fbeen established by the Greenham Trust
OL,13,Fto support riders aged between 18 and
OL,14,F25 from west Berkshire and north
OL,15,FHampshire.
OL,17,FThatcham Town Council said Boulton, who
OL,18,Fdied in January, "inspired countless
OL,19,Fpeople to enjoy and excel in cycling".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
