OL,3,GNEWSATribute cycling bursary set up to
OL,4,Ahelp young riders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual bursary, worth #1,500, will
OL,7,Fbe awarded to a young cyclist who
OL,8,Fdemonstrates "long-term potential, a
OL,9,Fstrong commitment to the sport, and a
OL,10,Fpositive contribution to the cycling
OL,11,Fcommunity".
